 <item>
 <title>Telegram macOS</title>
+<description>New:&lt;br&gt;• Mention your Dictator bot in any chat to ask the agent there, once Guest Mode is on in @BotFather (Open → your bot → Settings → Guest Mode)&lt;br&gt;• Ask the agent for the Stars history of your bots and channels, or export it to a spreadsheet&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Widgets run several times faster&lt;br&gt;• AI agents keep working while your Mac is locked if Telegram has no passcode; turn on Settings → AI Assistant → Lock When the Mac Locks to stop them&lt;br&gt;• Reaction, emoji and status pickers open faster and their emoji start playing right away&lt;br&gt;• Emoji, sticker and reaction panels keep only what is on screen and use much less memory&lt;br&gt;• Text recognition and subject lifting in images run in a separate sandboxed process&lt;br&gt;• Telegram holds less memory after viewing images and during video calls&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• Dictator no longer asks to let the agent's computer reach Hermes's own sites&lt;br&gt;• Hermes updates no longer roll back when the agent's computer restarts&lt;br&gt;• The reactions picker plays its emoji right away and its first reactions no longer flicker or vanish&lt;br&gt;</description>
+<pubDate>2026-18-11 23:09:11</pubDate>
